# Keep LF line endings on every OS (Git for Windows would otherwise convert to CRLF on checkout,
# which breaks the demo's git patches and the bash scripts). Binary files are detected automatically.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
